  "Id": 769,
  "Title": "International Day on Safety and Health",
  "NewsSubTitle": "Occupational Health, Safety and Environment (OHSE) Award for Aga Khan University Hospital",
  "NewsSummary": "High OHSE standards at AKU earned a \u2018Best Practices in Health, Safety and Environment\u2019 award from the Employers\u2019 Federation of Pakistan (EFP).",
  "GlobalNews": false,
  "AlternateNewsTitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSubtitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSummary": null,
  "NewsContent": "<div class=\"ExternalClass77D186FB6F354FC196134861D3583D2D\"><p>\u200bHigh OHSE standards at AKU earned a \u2018Best Practices in Health, Safety and Environment\u2019 award from the Employers\u2019 Federation of Pakistan (EFP). The award was part of a nationwide competition organised by the EFP in collaboration with the International Labour Organization (ILO) and UNAIDS to commemorate \u201cInternational Day on Health and Safety\u201d.Based on relevant data for years 2004 and 2005, key criteria for the competition included&#58; employee health monitoring programme, emergency preparedness, quality of the EHS (Environment, Health and Safety) management programme, leadership commitment, staff participation, training programmes and progress, incident reporting and analysis, and performance monitoring, etc. The University Hospital ensures the consistency of its high quality care through a meticulous process of continual quality assurance.<br></p></div>",
